                <pb facs="0297" n="217" sameAs="frus:frus1901/pg217"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr.
                            White.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-10-26"><hi rendition="#italic">October 26,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hay directs Mr. White to authorize Mr. Crane to accept, on behalf of
                    American claimants, the offer of the British Government of £6,000, in full
                    settlement.)</p>
            </div>
